```php
Route::get('/barang', [BarangController::class, 'index']);
Route::resource('barang', BarangController::class);
```
`Route::resource` petakan 7 laluan REST (index/create/store/show/edit/update/destroy) ke method controller. Letak API di `routes/api.php` (prefix `/api`, stateless) dan web di `routes/web.php` (sesi/CSRF).

